---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Venue Installation" description="Custom audio system design and installation for theatres, venues, churches, and performance spaces. Expert commissioning, tuning, and ongoing support from System Sound.">
  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-label">Venue Installation</p>
      <h1>Built for the <span style="color:var(--color-accent)">long run</span>.</h1>
      <p>Custom audio system design, installation, and commissioning for theatres, performance venues, churches, schools, hospitality, and public spaces.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="prose">
        <p>With 45+ years of experience and direct relationships with the world's best equipment manufacturers — including being a direct Meyer Sound distributor — System Sound offers end-to-end venue installation services that deliver premium, long-term audio solutions.</p>
        <p>We don't just install speakers. We design systems that work for your space, your users, and your budget — and we stick around to make sure they keep working.</p>

        <h2>What We Offer</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Venue assessment and acoustic analysis</strong> — understanding your space before we spec a single box.</li>
          <li><strong>System design and coverage prediction</strong> — ensuring every seat gets the same experience.</li>
          <li><strong>Equipment specification and supply</strong> — Meyer Sound, DiGiCo, Sennheiser, Shure, and more. Direct distributor pricing.</li>
          <li><strong>Installation and commissioning</strong> — professional rigging, cabling, tuning, and handover.</li>
          <li><strong>User training</strong> — making sure your team can operate the system confidently.</li>
          <li><strong>Ongoing support and maintenance</strong> — we're a phone call away, not a warranty card.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Venues We Work With</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Professional theatres and performing arts centres</li>
          <li>School halls, theatres, and music departments</li>
          <li>Churches and houses of worship</li>
          <li>Hospitality venues — restaurants, bars, nightclubs</li>
          <li>Corporate and conference spaces</li>
          <li>Community and council venues</li>
          <li>Outdoor and public spaces</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-label">Process</p>
      <div class="section-intro">
        <h2>How we work.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="card-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr))">
        <div class="card">
          <div style="font-size:2rem; margin-bottom:0.75rem; color:var(--color-accent)">1</div>
          <h4>Listen</h4>
          <p style="font-size:0.9rem">We visit your venue, understand your needs, your users, and your ambitions. No assumptions.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div style="font-size:2rem; margin-bottom:0.75rem; color:var(--color-accent)">2</div>
          <h4>Design</h4>
          <p style="font-size:0.9rem">We create a bespoke system design with coverage predictions, equipment schedules, and transparent pricing.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div style="font-size:2rem; margin-bottom:0.75rem; color:var(--color-accent)">3</div>
          <h4>Install</h4>
          <p style="font-size:0.9rem">Professional installation by experienced theatre technicians. Clean, safe, compliant. Minimal disruption.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div style="font-size:2rem; margin-bottom:0.75rem; color:var(--color-accent)">4</div>
          <h4>Support</h4>
          <p style="font-size:0.9rem">Training, documentation, and ongoing support. We're here for the life of the system — not just the warranty period.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Thinking about a venue upgrade?</h2>
      <p>Let's visit your space and talk about what's possible. No obligation, genuine advice.</p>
      <a href="/sales-enquiry-request" class="btn btn-primary">Arrange a consultation</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
